<view class="page">
  <view class="intro"><text class="title">Privacy notice</text><text>{{info.name}} · Version {{info.privacyVersion}}</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Who operates this service</text><text>{{info.operator || 'Operator details will be supplied before public release.'}}</text><text>{{info.contact || 'Contact the shop administrator for this development build.'}}</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">WeChat sign-in and account linking</text><text>Only after you choose to enter the workspace, WeChat provides a temporary login code. Our server exchanges it with WeChat and stores a one-way hash of the app-specific account identifier. The WeChat session key is not stored. Your website account email and shop permissions are associated only after you explicitly approve linking on the website.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Shop information and AI processing / 店铺资料与 AI 处理</text><text>We process products, stock, prices, order details, shipment references, messages and confirmation records to provide seller operations and a record of changes. You may access only records permitted by your seller account.</text><text>启用自然语言功能时，DeepSeek（深度求索）接收你的消息、最近对话，以及必要的商品名称、价格、库存、选项、订单编号、支付与待发货状态、商品数量，用于理解请求。系统不会自动发送客户姓名、联系方式、收货地址、账号密码或支付凭据。你主动写入聊天的内容会作为消息发送，请勿输入私人或敏感信息。模型返回的变更必须经过服务器校验，并由你确认后执行。模型不可用时，快捷操作仍可使用。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">On your device</text><text>We store your privacy choice, temporary sign-in token, current conversation identifier and pending request details in this app's local storage. Sign-in tokens expire after eight hours. Linking requests expire after five minutes. Copy buttons write the selected link or support address to your clipboard; we do not read your clipboard.</text><text>The native app does not request your location, contacts, microphone, camera or photo library. Product photos can be supplied separately through the website editor.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Retention and your choices</text><text>Business records remain in the seller database. Signing out clears this app's local session and consent; it does not erase business records or unlink the website account. You can unlink WeChat in the website's WeChat connection section. Contact the operator to request access, correction or deletion of your personal information, or closure of your account. Some transaction and audit records may need to be retained where applicable obligations require them.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Security and service providers</text><text>Requests use HTTPS. The server limits access by seller and records confirmed changes. WeChat provides sign-in; the hosting provider stores and processes service data for operation of this app. We do not sell personal information or provide advertising tracking in this release.</text><button wx:if="{{info.contact}}" bindtap="contact">Copy privacy contact email</button></view>
</view>
